[{"start": 0.3, "end": 1.5004429678848283, "text": "Your car is filthy.", "words": [{"w": "Your", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.57}, {"w": "car", "s": 0.6, "e": 0.816}, {"w": "is", "s": 0.84, "e": 1.002}, {"w": "filthy.", "s": 1.02, "e": 1.452}]}, {"start": 1.8004429678848284, "end": 4.381395348837209, "text": "So you blast it with a garden sprinkler...", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 1.8, "e": 1.963}, {"w": "you", "s": 1.981, "e": 2.197}, {"w": "blast", "s": 2.221, "e": 2.545}, {"w": "it", "s": 2.581, "e": 2.743}, {"w": "with", "s": 2.761, "e": 3.031}, {"w": "a", "s": 3.061, "e": 3.169}, {"w": "garden", "s": 3.181, "e": 3.559}, {"w": "sprinkler...", "s": 3.601, "e": 4.303}]}, {"start": 4.681395348837209, "end": 7.022259136212624, "text": "and turn your backyard into a mud pit.", "words": [{"w": "and", "s": 4.681, "e": 4.897}, {"w": "turn", "s": 4.921, "e": 5.192}, {"w": "your", "s": 5.222, "e": 5.492}, {"w": "backyard", "s": 5.522, "e": 6.008}, {"w": "into", "s": 6.062, "e": 6.332}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.362, "e": 6.47}, {"w": "mud", "s": 6.482, "e": 6.698}, {"w": "pit.", "s": 6.722, "e": 6.992}]}, {"start": 7.322259136212624, "end": 9.543078626799556, "text": "Now the tires are worse than before.", "words": [{"w": "Now", "s": 7.322, "e": 7.538}, {"w": "the", "s": 7.562, "e": 7.778}, {"w": "tires", "s": 7.802, "e": 8.127}, {"w": "are", "s": 8.163, "e": 8.379}, {"w": "worse", "s": 8.403, "e": 8.727}, {"w": "than", "s": 8.763, "e": 9.033}, {"w": "before.", "s": 9.063, "e": 9.495}]}, {"start": 9.843078626799556, "end": 17.04573643410853, "text": "So you pour a concrete slab, tilted slightly toward a drain, so the dirty water flows into a tank, not across the lawn.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 9.843, "e": 10.005}, {"w": "you", "s": 10.023, "e": 10.239}, {"w": "pour", "s": 10.263, "e": 10.533}, {"w": "a", "s": 10.563, "e": 10.671}, {"w": "concrete", "s": 10.683, "e": 11.17}, {"w": "slab,", "s": 11.224, "e": 11.548}, {"w": "tilted", "s": 11.584, "e": 11.962}, {"w": "slightly", "s": 12.004, "e": 12.49}, {"w": "toward", "s": 12.544, "e": 12.922}, {"w": "a", "s": 12.964, "e": 13.072}, {"w": "drain,", "s": 13.084, "e": 13.462}, {"w": "so", "s": 13.504, "e": 13.666}, {"w": "the", "s": 13.684, "e": 13.901}, {"w": "dirty", "s": 13.925, "e": 14.249}, {"w": "water", "s": 14.285, "e": 14.609}, {"w": "flows", "s": 14.645, "e": 14.969}, {"w": "into", "s": 15.005, "e": 15.275}, {"w": "a", "s": 15.305, "e": 15.413}, {"w": "tank,", "s": 15.425, "e": 15.749}, {"w": "not", "s": 15.785, "e": 16.001}, {"w": "across", "s": 16.025, "e": 16.403}, {"w": "the", "s": 16.446, "e": 16.662}, {"w": "lawn.", "s": 16.686, "e": 17.01}]}, {"start": 17.34573643410853, "end": 19.566555924695464, "text": "But a sprinkler only soaks the roof.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 17.346, "e": 17.562}, {"w": "a", "s": 17.586, "e": 17.694}, {"w": "sprinkler", "s": 17.706, "e": 18.246}, {"w": "only", "s": 18.306, "e": 18.576}, {"w": "soaks", "s": 18.606, "e": 18.93}, {"w": "the", "s": 18.966, "e": 19.182}, {"w": "roof.", "s": 19.206, "e": 19.531}]}, {"start": 19.866555924695465, "end": 21.907308970099674, "text": "The doors and bumpers stay dirty.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 19.867, "e": 20.083}, {"w": "doors", "s": 20.107, "e": 20.431}, {"w": "and", "s": 20.467, "e": 20.683}, {"w": "bumpers", "s": 20.707, "e": 21.139}, {"w": "stay", "s": 21.187, "e": 21.457}, {"w": "dirty.", "s": 21.487, "e": 21.865}]}, {"start": 22.207308970099675, "end": 26.829014396456266, "text": "So you bend a pipe into an arch, and fill it with nozzles aimed down and in.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 22.207, "e": 22.369}, {"w": "you", "s": 22.387, "e": 22.603}, {"w": "bend", "s": 22.627, "e": 22.898}, {"w": "a", "s": 22.928, "e": 23.036}, {"w": "pipe", "s": 23.048, "e": 23.318}, {"w": "into", "s": 23.348, "e": 23.618}, {"w": "an", "s": 23.648, "e": 23.81}, {"w": "arch,", "s": 23.828, "e": 24.152}, {"w": "and", "s": 24.188, "e": 24.404}, {"w": "fill", "s": 24.428, "e": 24.698}, {"w": "it", "s": 24.728, "e": 24.89}, {"w": "with", "s": 24.908, "e": 25.178}, {"w": "nozzles", "s": 25.208, "e": 25.641}, {"w": "aimed", "s": 25.689, "e": 26.013}, {"w": "down", "s": 26.049, "e": 26.319}, {"w": "and", "s": 26.349, "e": 26.565}, {"w": "in.", "s": 26.589, "e": 26.805}]}, {"start": 27.129014396456267, "end": 30.790365448504993, "text": "Then you put it on rails, so it rolls from bumper to bumper.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 27.129, "e": 27.399}, {"w": "you", "s": 27.429, "e": 27.645}, {"w": "put", "s": 27.669, "e": 27.885}, {"w": "it", "s": 27.909, "e": 28.071}, {"w": "on", "s": 28.089, "e": 28.251}, {"w": "rails,", "s": 28.269, "e": 28.648}, {"w": "so", "s": 28.69, "e": 28.852}, {"w": "it", "s": 28.87, "e": 29.032}, {"w": "rolls", "s": 29.05, "e": 29.374}, {"w": "from", "s": 29.41, "e": 29.68}, {"w": "bumper", "s": 29.71, "e": 30.088}, {"w": "to", "s": 30.13, "e": 30.292}, {"w": "bumper.", "s": 30.31, "e": 30.742}]}, {"start": 31.090365448504993, "end": 32.71096345514951, "text": "Now water hits everywhere.", "words": [{"w": "Now", "s": 31.09, "e": 31.306}, {"w": "water", "s": 31.33, "e": 31.655}, {"w": "hits", "s": 31.691, "e": 31.961}, {"w": "everywhere.", "s": 31.991, "e": 32.639}]}, {"start": 33.01096345514951, "end": 35.23178294573644, "text": "But grease doesn't care about water.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 33.011, "e": 33.227}, {"w": "grease", "s": 33.251, "e": 33.629}, {"w": "doesn't", "s": 33.671, "e": 34.103}, {"w": "care", "s": 34.151, "e": 34.421}, {"w": "about", "s": 34.451, "e": 34.776}, {"w": "water.", "s": 34.812, "e": 35.19}]}, {"start": 35.53178294573644, "end": 36.55215946843854, "text": "So you add soap.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 35.532, "e": 35.694}, {"w": "you", "s": 35.712, "e": 35.928}, {"w": "add", "s": 35.952, "e": 36.168}, {"w": "soap.", "s": 36.192, "e": 36.516}]}, {"start": 36.852159468438536, "end": 42.494241417497236, "text": "The arch foams the whole car, the grime loosens, and a pump blasts it off with high pressure.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 36.852, "e": 37.068}, {"w": "arch", "s": 37.092, "e": 37.362}, {"w": "foams", "s": 37.392, "e": 37.716}, {"w": "the", "s": 37.752, "e": 37.969}, {"w": "whole", "s": 37.993, "e": 38.317}, {"w": "car,", "s": 38.353, "e": 38.623}, {"w": "the", "s": 38.653, "e": 38.869}, {"w": "grime", "s": 38.893, "e": 39.217}, {"w": "loosens,", "s": 39.253, "e": 39.739}, {"w": "and", "s": 39.793, "e": 40.009}, {"w": "a", "s": 40.033, "e": 40.141}, {"w": "pump", "s": 40.153, "e": 40.423}, {"w": "blasts", "s": 40.453, "e": 40.832}, {"w": "it", "s": 40.874, "e": 41.036}, {"w": "off", "s": 41.054, "e": 41.27}, {"w": "with", "s": 41.294, "e": 41.564}, {"w": "high", "s": 41.594, "e": 41.864}, {"w": "pressure.", "s": 41.894, "e": 42.434}]}, {"start": 42.79424141749723, "end": 43.21439645625692, "text": "Clean!", "words": [{"w": "Clean!", "s": 42.794, "e": 43.172}]}, {"start": 43.51439645625692, "end": 44.594795127353265, "text": "Until it dries...", "words": [{"w": "Until", "s": 43.514, "e": 43.839}, {"w": "it", "s": 43.875, "e": 44.037}, {"w": "dries...", "s": 44.055, "e": 44.541}]}, {"start": 44.89479512735326, "end": 46.33532668881506, "text": "and white spots appear.", "words": [{"w": "and", "s": 44.895, "e": 45.111}, {"w": "white", "s": 45.135, "e": 45.459}, {"w": "spots", "s": 45.495, "e": 45.819}, {"w": "appear.", "s": 45.855, "e": 46.287}]}, {"start": 46.635326688815056, "end": 49.996566998892575, "text": "That's minerals, left behind when the water evaporates.", "words": [{"w": "That's", "s": 46.635, "e": 47.013}, {"w": "minerals,", "s": 47.055, "e": 47.596}, {"w": "left", "s": 47.656, "e": 47.926}, {"w": "behind", "s": 47.956, "e": 48.334}, {"w": "when", "s": 48.376, "e": 48.646}, {"w": "the", "s": 48.676, "e": 48.892}, {"w": "water", "s": 48.916, "e": 49.24}, {"w": "evaporates.", "s": 49.276, "e": 49.925}]}, {"start": 50.29656699889257, "end": 54.978294573643424, "text": "So the last rinse runs through a reverse osmosis filter that strips them out.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 50.297, "e": 50.459}, {"w": "the", "s": 50.477, "e": 50.693}, {"w": "last", "s": 50.717, "e": 50.987}, {"w": "rinse", "s": 51.017, "e": 51.341}, {"w": "runs", "s": 51.377, "e": 51.647}, {"w": "through", "s": 51.677, "e": 52.109}, {"w": "a", "s": 52.157, "e": 52.265}, {"w": "reverse", "s": 52.277, "e": 52.709}, {"w": "osmosis", "s": 52.757, "e": 53.19}, {"w": "filter", "s": 53.238, "e": 53.616}, {"w": "that", "s": 53.658, "e": 53.928}, {"w": "strips", "s": 53.958, "e": 54.336}, {"w": "them", "s": 54.378, "e": 54.648}, {"w": "out.", "s": 54.678, "e": 54.948}]}, {"start": 55.27829457364342, "end": 56.23864894795128, "text": "One final pass.", "words": [{"w": "One", "s": 55.278, "e": 55.494}, {"w": "final", "s": 55.518, "e": 55.843}, {"w": "pass.", "s": 55.879, "e": 56.203}]}, {"start": 56.53864894795128, "end": 58.879512735326706, "text": "Then giant blowers push the water off.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 56.539, "e": 56.809}, {"w": "giant", "s": 56.839, "e": 57.163}, {"w": "blowers", "s": 57.199, "e": 57.631}, {"w": "push", "s": 57.679, "e": 57.949}, {"w": "the", "s": 57.979, "e": 58.195}, {"w": "water", "s": 58.219, "e": 58.543}, {"w": "off.", "s": 58.579, "e": 58.85}]}, {"start": 59.1795127353267, "end": 60.199889258028804, "text": "Congratulations.", "words": [{"w": "Congratulations.", "s": 59.18, "e": 60.098}]}, {"start": 60.4998892580288, "end": 62.12048726467332, "text": "You just built a car wash.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 60.5, "e": 60.716}, {"w": "just", "s": 60.74, "e": 61.01}, {"w": "built", "s": 61.04, "e": 61.364}, {"w": "a", "s": 61.4, "e": 61.508}, {"w": "car", "s": 61.52, "e": 61.736}, {"w": "wash.", "s": 61.76, "e": 62.084}]}]